<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian forces are considering deploying troops to support Saudi Arabia against the Houthis while denying any presence in Yemen. Unidentified gunmen killed one Syrian soldier and wounded two in eastern Deir ez-Zor, with similar attacks reported in Jadidat Bakara. Lebanon has asked Syria to extradite suspects linked to the killing of an ex-Iraqi MP. Syrian security officials are restructuring the army and preparing new security and administrative changes. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOMDRzLVFKYU5SQjBqZDMyZm5hT3FGeDJybE5OZWVPeGNOZ2ZGZ25JazBJVWc1Y1VKYlY5Rm03UGhlU1hqR0p1V3Nmd1BucE5kcHJLS0RYQ0dyN1NXaklGSlNlczNoa3otNDB0Mzg3U1NaeHpVQWd4S0YyVElzODhCMjQzUlU0SHJWaFZlXzlJenVFTTRqNHkzdHd5ckdTRnYxbHR3dklzbzUwY012emdXREh2OEo0SzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNLXNycnVSRjdCSmM2QTlSQ3FFcnd0Nnp4MkcxN2RrX1NHeERWVThvSEZyYi1saUlaZWhxNjJUak1RZ3NhdlB4NjN1VGtVdjY4a3lsaDJyVkU3ejEyNzNaTDdLX1Z5YXd4TFNCSS1JaFc2Qy1rVmF0QUVJTUw5Ym1zblpnTWc1UlA3amlyQ1U1TTNINHVUa1FOODdjYmtpTS1vc3h2ZVVVQi1EZzNTUHMwNW5tWHRHdzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera Centre for Studies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;VOA - Voice of America English News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOZEpyTXl2OUEtWlRjLVNBMWswN0ZRakY1bzVsX2xReVhnU3k1dUlHcVlFVkgtMGpRREIxUFlweElxd1hDRGRqc2hpSV8wdmtkaHNFLXZtWFVpbUNoNW81ZVBHb0xpMm8zX0FsbDdZYVhfdjVYOUxzYmd4UkhjN0VwU0Y5MUVHZGsx?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jewish Policy Center&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNSWdBX1RzeUNLUnRTOS1od0JlVTdsU1Q4NEY1UjhIS2tST0VaWmpxcEViSkZwQ0J4OV9Ce